{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"13d30f73da263899","type":"text","text":"# CEH 1","x":-410,"y":-122,"width":116,"height":60},
		{"id":"849c9bb613c21856","type":"text","text":"### Infromation Security Concepts","x":-201,"y":-122,"width":336,"height":60},
		{"id":"ca59cf88e3746d54","type":"text","text":"Infromation security `information` ko protect ya safe rakhati hai. jisame koi bhi `unauthrized` tarike se `data` ko `transmit` na kar sake. `information` 1 bahut hi jaruri `data` hota hai `organization` ke liye jisase vo protect karati hai.  jo isame `sensetive` information hoti hai vo kisi bhi galat hatho mai na pad jaye , agar pad gayi to bahut bada loss ho sakata hai jisame included hai \n- Finance Loss\n- Brand Reputation\n- Costumers Data","x":217,"y":-227,"width":503,"height":271},
		{"id":"07a4b80e8535701c","type":"text","text":"Element of information security","x":830,"y":-121,"width":286,"height":60},
		{"id":"01079749de348ad2","type":"text","text":"Non-Repudation","x":1391,"y":139,"width":156,"height":60},
		{"id":"49798236712c3595","type":"text","text":"Authenticity","x":1391,"y":15,"width":156,"height":60},
		{"id":"b61ef784f880a31f","type":"text","text":"Availablity","x":1391,"y":-121,"width":156,"height":60},
		{"id":"65a7a614fe1627d6","type":"text","text":"Intergity","x":1391,"y":-250,"width":156,"height":60},
		{"id":"ec1c24a99ba8eb1d","type":"text","text":"Confedently","x":1391,"y":-377,"width":156,"height":60},
		{"id":"49ffd142d9795383","type":"text","text":"Confedently means - ye data keval `authrised` person se hi access kiya jayega vo kisi bhi tarike se kar satka hai \nExample\n```\nDVD, USB, BLUE-RAY ETC\n```","x":1292,"y":-622,"width":354,"height":197},
		{"id":"50320fe1acfdd209","type":"text","text":"Information can see only `authrized`  person","x":1292,"y":-722,"width":354,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e4fe9fbd484f99c1","type":"text","text":"Intergity 1 `trustworthy` data hota hai jo ise `trustworthy` person hi access kar sakata h . kyu ki vo isame `add update or delete` sab kar sakata h","x":1680,"y":-384,"width":436,"height":106},
		{"id":"a4298bebfbe2b111","type":"text","text":"Ye data bilkul sahi ho , ye data check sum mai bhi `mapa` jata hai jisame `mathmatical` function ka use karake check kiya jata hai ki kahi data `change` to nahi hua na","x":2148,"y":-384,"width":379,"height":106},
		{"id":"339733382104e848","type":"text","text":"Isme Pura System reponsible hota hai `data ko delever store ya process` karane ke liye . `authrised user` se.","x":1680,"y":-227,"width":436,"height":106},
		{"id":"e87c20ed0f65a5e3","type":"text","text":"is data ko `disk array for redudant system` or `clustred machine` `anivirus software` to compact malware. me mapa jata hai or distibuted `dos attacks` ke liye bhi","x":2168,"y":-227,"width":339,"height":106},
		{"id":"63eeddea6f05cbec","type":"text","text":"Data can't be `changed`","x":1680,"y":-492,"width":436,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6681f485fd29fe62","type":"text","text":"System should be available when we `need`","x":1680,"y":-91,"width":436,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a15a5eb8b59d8dd4","type":"text","text":"isme check karana hota hai ki user `authencated` ya `guniun` hai koi fake person to nahi h na . vo check karata hai \n- Documents\n- Biometric \n- Smart card\n- Digital Certificate \n- Transactions\n- Communications","x":1680,"y":-12,"width":436,"height":274},
		{"id":"a237f1bc79e10868","type":"text","text":"Ye guarntee leta hai ki `message` 100% deliverd hoga. koi `deny` nahi koi `error` nahi ","x":1296,"y":262,"width":347,"height":85},
		{"id":"ee4123388c6030c6","type":"text","text":"Infromation Security Attacks","x":844,"y":607,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d8ba53e7ea05f9d1","type":"text","text":"1 Attacker kisi bhi it system ki security ko `breach` karne ke liye ye action leta hai ki vo ya to use `exploit` karega ya koi `vulnerablity` find out karega","x":844,"y":745,"width":250,"height":149},
		{"id":"10f51258837249c5","type":"text","text":"Isme `malecious software` or `commands` ho sakati h jo `software` ya `hardware` se vulnerablity find kar sakti h. ","x":1178,"y":761,"width":250,"height":118},
		{"id":"1c4f69c819364a68","type":"text","text":"Attacks","x":1522,"y":790,"width":90,"height":60},
		{"id":"a3b451b840762dca","type":"text","text":"Vulnerablity","x":1781,"y":943,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"40789703c40b8809","type":"text","text":"Methods(TTP)","x":1781,"y":790,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"8eacf1579e57a3dc","type":"text","text":"Motive","x":1781,"y":639,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"48a92b5c8af8c4fc","type":"text","text":"Examples","x":1783,"y":518,"width":117,"height":60},
		{"id":"5c212676f545239e","type":"text","text":"Attacker ke pas `information secutiry` attack ke liye kuchh motive ya goals ho sakte hai. Is attacks ke andar `organization ko disrupt` karana ya `valuable data churana` aadi goal ho sakte h. ye kam karane ke liye bahut sari `techniques or tools` ka use kiya ja sakta h","x":2269,"y":468,"width":579,"height":116},
		{"id":"a302432757aff2ed","type":"text","text":"- Distrupt Bussiness continuty\n- Perform Information Theft\n- Manipulating Data\n- Create fear and chaos by distrupting critical infrastructure\n- Bring financial loss\n- Propogate religious or political belief\n- Archive a state military objectives\n- Demage the reputation the target\n- Take revenge\n- Demand ransom","x":2269,"y":125,"width":517,"height":310},
		{"id":"b40b28fd2be0bd91","type":"text","text":"Tatics","x":2087,"y":695,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"858bba0a74d737b5","type":"text","text":"Techniques","x":2086,"y":790,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"a7dabacfbea31877","type":"text","text":"Procudures","x":2087,"y":879,"width":139,"height":60},
		{"id":"1337a1a10d2cf0e8","type":"text","text":"`Tatics` 1 strategy hai jo attacker starting se end tak follow karata hai","x":2269,"y":695,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"f7948e9908ad1dd7","type":"text","text":"Attack ke doran `intermediate` result achieve karane ke liye","x":2269,"y":790,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"c85d253c50b2030f","type":"text","text":"Ye 1 sysmatic approach hai jo hacker attack launch karate time karata h","x":2269,"y":879,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"beca110d1a08a691","type":"text","text":"Vulnerability system ko implement karate time jo `kamiya` rah jati h , ya koi `loopholes` reh jate hai jinki help se hacker `system ke andar login` kar sakta hai `unauthrized` tarike se . `ye software ya hardware` dono m ho sakti h","x":1634,"y":1061,"width":433,"height":141},
		{"id":"ef9bff4c5ce4035c","type":"text","text":"Common Reasons behind the existence vulnerablity","x":1634,"y":1247,"width":433,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"62c3256b6fcee80f","type":"text","text":"Inherent technology weakness","x":1235,"y":1518,"width":278,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"15a6e0281cfe93bf","type":"text","text":"Hardware software misconfiguration","x":1540,"y":1518,"width":302,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"4e6328b36b0e2ec7","type":"text","text":"Careless approach of end users","x":1870,"y":1523,"width":274,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"145ed17f36cf6212","type":"text","text":"Insecure poor design of the network of application","x":2184,"y":1518,"width":409,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5a467ec71e081b88","type":"text","text":"Hardware or Software kisi bhi type ke attack ke liye cabable na ho . to vo `Network mai vulnerable` ho sakta h  . Isme kuchh attacks ho sakte h jaise `DoS` or `MITM` attacks.","x":878,"y":1465,"width":270,"height":167},
		{"id":"3650cd719ec77a4a","type":"text","text":"For Example: System is running on `old version` of web browser. And `system are not updated` A small `trozen` attack force the user to send and clean enite storage","x":574,"y":1465,"width":250,"height":167},
		{"id":"768e3f17a55c2eb0","type":"text","text":"Hardware ki misconfiguration bhi aapke system ko hack kara sakti hai\nEx. Encrepted Protocol -> leackage your sensetive data/information\n","x":1235,"y":1632,"width":278,"height":179},
		{"id":"fb1b85c9dfa1b756","type":"text","text":"Insecure design network: Agar aapke IDS, FIREBASE, VPN secure implement nahi hai tab bhi aap hack ho sakte h","x":2184,"y":1632,"width":409,"height":93},
		{"id":"6c9eeb169b2f30af","type":"text","text":"Human nature bhi aapke data ko loss kara sakta hai . isme sabse bada example hai `social engineering` jaha attacker aapke data ko publically ya phir aapse puchh kar bhi nikal sakate h","x":1870,"y":1632,"width":274,"height":179},
		{"id":"d90de18ecdfca55c","type":"text","text":"Some Types of Vulnerability","x":2840,"y":955,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6fd3854eeb518f44","type":"text","text":"TCP / IP protocol","x":3423,"y":819,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c30a0da6f87c673f","type":"text","text":"Internet service misconfiguration","x":3423,"y":695,"width":293,"height":60},
		{"id":"6cf55cbe52ed5cfd","type":"text","text":"User Account Vulnerability","x":3423,"y":955,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7dbea66b74462f00","type":"text","text":"Network Device Vulnerability","x":3423,"y":1079,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cadcc60195a9e106","type":"text","text":"OS Vulnerability","x":3423,"y":1215,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cbed6f195b7b54fc","type":"text","text":"System Account Vulnerability","x":3423,"y":1334,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d133e9669240d1c5","type":"text","text":"Network device misconfigurations","x":3423,"y":1457,"width":293,"height":58},
		{"id":"0b59b27de22253e5","type":"text","text":"Default Password & settings","x":3423,"y":575,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"587497b0498b4915","type":"text","text":"Orginating for setting of weak passwords for system account","x":3741,"y":1334,"width":498,"height":60},
		{"id":"e595e6a5976a0c12","type":"text","text":"Various Network devices such as `router , firewall and switches `\n\n- Lack of password protection\n- Lack of authentication\n- Insecure routing protocol\n- Firewall vulnerability","x":3741,"y":1116,"width":280,"height":198},
